<div class="page-container page-about">
  <div class="page-header text-center">
    <span class="section-tag mono">ABOUT SNAKER</span>
    <h1 class="page-title">{{t "aboutPage.title"}}</h1>
    <p class="page-lead center-block">{{t "aboutPage.lead"}}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="site-container">
    <div class="about-content-body max-width-reader center-block">
      <div class="about-narrative-card">
        <h2>The Core Problem in Ecommerce</h2>
        <p>
          For over a decade, retail entrepreneurs faced an artificial dilemma: either spend tens of thousands of dollars and months of engineering building an ecommerce system from scratch, or get locked into confusing multi-plugin platforms that charge fees on top of fees.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most businesses simply need to show their catalog beautifully, collect orders reliably, and get paid straight to their bank account. They do not need to become software maintainers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-narrative-card">
        <h2>The Snaker Architecture</h2>
        <p>
          Snaker isolates the technical heavy lifting — hosting, server-side security, pre-rendered page performance, and database integrity — so the merchant can focus 100% on merchandise, photography, and customer relationships.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether starting with our Free tier using direct WhatsApp ordering or operating on custom domain infrastructure, your store remains clean, autonomous, and modern.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-actions-row text-center">
        <a href="/{{currentLang}}/pricing" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
          <span>Explore plans</span>
          <span class="btn-arrow">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/{{currentLang}}/contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-large">
          <span>Get in touch</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
